I've left out both operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `HTTPClient` for four hosts. It has no filesystem capability, so it can't write `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`. And `metadata.internal.example` is outside the allowlist, so the enrichment call would trap at the boundary. Sending each feed's text to that service would also send untrusted content to a host the node was never granted. Logging belongs in the host runtime or in a node that holds a granted log capability.

